      "name": "[Fragile] High-Grade Blade of the Other: Rush",
      "desc": "When equipped, this item grants three Alter Skills: Perfect Block, Phase Dash, and Powerful Slash.\n\n[Phase Dash Enhancement]\nEnhancement I: If the target has an enhanced Cacophony Shield, the Shield is reduced by an additional <color=#2BAD00>100%/50%/30%</color> for normal/elite/boss enemies, respectively. Powerful Slash increases Daze buildup against normal/elite/boss enemies that have not entered combat by an additional <color=#2BAD00>100%/50%/25%</color>, respectively.\n\nEnhancement II: Defeating a boss enemy restores 1 use of Blade of the Other.",
